UnitVelodromeMigration::ClaimFees
├── when the reward contract reports the Optimism chain identifier
│   ├── given the claimed token balance is positive
│   │   └── it should transfer the locally claimed token balance
│   └── given the claimed token balance is zero
│       └── it should query the token balance without transferring
├── when the reward contract reports another chain identifier
│   └── it should skip token calls for the remote reward
└── when the reward contract chain identifier call reverts
    └── it should transfer the locally claimed token balance
